  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.0.3\n      - PERF: SelectSqlQueryListAsync / SelectStoredProcedureListAsync now internally cache their DbCommand and RowFactory after the first call (keyed by connection + query text + CommandType). Every subsequent call for the same query reuses the pre-built command (no CreateCommand / CreateParameter), skips GetOrAdd in RowFactoryCache, and pre-sizes List<T> from the previous call's row count — matching the hot-path cost of CompiledSqlQuery<T>.ToListAsync while keeping the simple Dictionary parameter API.\n      - PERF: Hot-path parameter update (UpdateCommandParameters) only mutates .Value on already-typed SqlParameters — no type inference, no boxing for common CLR types.\n      - Previous (v10.0.4): [ThreadStatic] race-condition fix, independent SchemaFingerprint hashes, ASCII bitmask in fingerprint, IAsyncEnumerable streaming, DateTimeOffset support, adaptive List pre-sizing in CompiledSqlQuery.",
